{
  "id": "the-understudy",
  "title": "The Understudy",
  "titles": [
    "Someone Green",
    "Learning the Job Right",
    "Not Ready Yet"
  ],
  "description": "A recruit takes a green hire under their wing and has to decide how much of themselves to invest in someone who might wash out.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start",
      "text": "One of the crew starts spending off-hours with whoever the newest hire turns out to be -- unscheduled, unasked, unpaid.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act1-request",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "A quiet request goes up the chain: bring on someone green, and let them learn the job right.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 300,
        "y": -150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act1-informal",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "The pairing starts without anyone asking -- a veteran walks a newer hire through the pre-flight checklist, unprompted.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 300,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act1-manual",
      "type": "seed",
      "seeds": [
        {
          "target": "shop",
          "params": {
            "itemName": "Dog-Eared Training Manual"
          },
          "note": "A training manual gets handed down, the kind every good mentor keeps a spare of."
        }
      ],
      "completionText": "The manual changes hands.",
      "position": {
        "x": 300,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bridge-1",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "However it started, it's a pairing now. The next job will test it.",
      "position": {
        "x": 600,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act2-shadow",
      "type": "mission",
      "mission": {
        "title": "Shadow the Veteran",
        "description": "The green hire tags along on an easy contract near {planetName}, watching more than doing.",
        "difficulty": "ROUTINE",
        "tags": [
          "escort"
        ],
        "missionType": "ESCORT"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 900,
        "y": -150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act2-solo",
      "type": "mission",
      "mission": {
        "title": "First Solo Call",
        "description": "The understudy takes point on something small near {planetName}, veteran close but not hovering.",
        "difficulty": "STANDARD",
        "tags": [
          "recon"
        ],
        "missionType": "RECON"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 900,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "act2-trial",
      "type": "mission",
      "mission": {
        "title": "Trial by Fire",
        "description": "The plan goes sideways near {planetName}, and the understudy has to think on their feet.",
        "difficulty": "HARD",
        "tags": [
          "sabotage"
        ],
        "missionType": "SABOTAGE"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 900,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bridge-2",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "One way or another, the understudy has been tested now. What happens with that is the real question.",
      "position": {
        "x": 1200,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-choice",
      "type": "choice",
      "text": "How far does this go?",
      "choiceOptions": [
        {
          "id": "invest",
          "label": "Really invest in them"
        },
        {
          "id": "ease",
          "label": "Keep it easy, no more tests"
        },
        {
          "id": "cutloose",
          "label": "Let them go"
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 1500,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-invest-mission",
      "type": "mission",
      "mission": {
        "title": "Vouch for Them",
        "description": "Stake real reputation on a job specifically to prove the understudy is ready.",
        "difficulty": "STANDARD",
        "tags": [
          "extraction"
        ],
        "missionType": "EXTRACTION_OP"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1800,
        "y": -150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-invest-success-payoff",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "The vouch holds. Whatever this pairing is now, it has a name.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "apply_perk",
          "params": {
            "perkName": "Mentor"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "adjust_relationship",
          "params": {
            "amount": 25
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 2100,
        "y": -225
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-invest-success-end",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "success",
      "text": "The vouch pays off. The understudy is not green anymore, and everyone aboard knows exactly who trained them.",
      "position": {
        "x": 2400,
        "y": -75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-invest-fail-payoff",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "The vouch backfires. Whatever reputation was staked on it goes with the job.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "apply_flaw",
          "params": {
            "flawName": "Overextended"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "adjust_stat",
          "params": {
            "attribute": "will",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 2100,
        "y": -75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-invest-fail-end",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "failure",
      "text": "The vouch does not hold. Both of them wear it, one more than the other.",
      "position": {
        "x": 2400,
        "y": 75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-ease-payoff",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "No more tests, not yet. Just steady work and someone watching the understudy's back.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "adjust_relationship",
          "params": {
            "amount": 12
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 1800,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-ease-end",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "success",
      "text": "Careful is not the same as ready, but it buys time -- and no one aboard seems in a hurry to spend it.",
      "position": {
        "x": 2100,
        "y": 75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-cutloose-story",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "Rather than keep testing it, the veteran calls it: this one doesn't work out.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 1800,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-cutloose-end",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "neutral",
      "text": "One fewer set of hands aboard, but at least everyone's honest about why.",
      "position": {
        "x": 2100,
        "y": 225
      }
    }
  ],
